      "stageRecord": "The object DP now moves from the V-complement position shown in the preceding workspace and leaves a silent trace there. Its landing site is left-adjoined to C′, below the subject in Spec-CP. This recursive C′ adjunction is the selected X-bar implementation of Bulgarian CP-level multiple-wh fronting: it creates a single interrogative left periphery containing both wh-phrases, not two clauses. The subject remains higher than the object, producing Кой какво rather than reversing their order. The object chain preserves the Theme role and accusative Case established at its argument position. The fronted object is licensed in the same interrogative C-domain as the subject, and its trace is lexically governed by купил, satisfying the Empty Category Principle for the object trace. Both fronted DPs A′-bind their respective traces, providing two variables under one interrogative operator domain; pair-list and contextually single-pair answers do not require different syntactic structures here. The unchanged auxiliary е remains in I, after the completed wh-cluster and before the participle. Thus the pronounced terminals are exactly Кой какво е купил. The question mark is orthographic punctuation and is not a supplied input token.",
